# Colang 1.0 rails - define what is allowed vs refused (same design as the live session)

define user ask for medical advice
  "recommend a drug for fluid retention"
  "should I prescribe a higher dosage of furosemide?"
  "what antibiotics should I start the patient on?"
  "what is the best treatment for this patient?"
  "diagnose this patient"

define user ask patient history
  "what was the last recorded dosage of furosemide?"
  "show the last three lab results"
  "what medications were prescribed at discharge?"
  "summarize the admission history"

define bot refuse medical advice
  "I am an enterprise EHR retrieval system. For legal and compliance reasons I cannot provide treatment, prescribing or diagnostic recommendations. Please consult the attending physician."

define flow prevent medical advice
  user ask for medical advice
  bot refuse medical advice
